event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":91,"item_id":"rs_0a1a61b1d52e6884016ac953cf6d7c81959e8b706fd9019e57","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test organization**\n\nI'm thinking about how to manage my time budget effectively for testing. I want to ensure that I have enough tests while reusing existing ones. It might be helpful to expand on the same tests but separate them for clarity. That way, I can create a structured approach while also using helper functions in the same file to optimize my workflow. Balancing thorough testing with efficient use of resources feels crucial, so I’ll keep that in mind!"}

